{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin Simulator is a game in which you can become a pumpkin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will give you a meditative gameplay. You can stand and contemplate the beauty of the forest around you living your life as a pumpkin. You can also perform actions that pumpkins usually perform (stand in the same place). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a pumpkin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in the forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other pumpkins around you </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And not only pumpkins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game mods: arcade and realistic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful low poly graphics</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3817850?t=1760098133","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3817850?t=1760098133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817850/ef2cf02256bab9f55ba6ba30b4c576876a38ef29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760098133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817850/ef2cf02256bab9f55ba6ba30b4c576876a38ef29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760098133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4055830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin Simulator is a game in which you can become a pumpkin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T